WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:01.501
Near the end of training camp.

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.336
He was coming down the steps

00:00:03.336 --> 00:00:05.572
and he came up to me and said, Hi,

00:00:05.572 --> 00:00:07.040
I'm Tom Brady.

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:08.241
I said, I know who you are.

00:00:08.241 --> 00:00:09.576
You're sixth round

00:00:09.576 --> 00:00:11.211
draft pick from Michigan.

00:00:11.211 --> 00:00:13.346
He looked me in the eye and he said,

00:00:13.346 --> 00:00:14.681
I'm the best decision

00:00:14.681 --> 00:00:16.950
your franchise has ever made.

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:20.053
We just gave the biggest contract

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:22.922
any quarterback to Drew Bledsoe,

00:00:23.156 --> 00:00:24.424
and he was number four.

00:00:24.424 --> 00:00:26.593
And that job, he came down

00:00:26.593 --> 00:00:29.062
and he really believed what he said

00:00:29.362 --> 00:00:30.296
and he was right.

